                                                "sense_id": "6e20b7d9-6064-3f0b-830c-0573699bc017",
                                                "text": "A Guardia Civil spokesperson said that ayahuasca, San Pedro, toad poison, wild rue and mimosa pudica were prohibited substances in Spain, adding that their consumption was not authorised because, while they were natural substances, they could be highly dangerous to human health."
                                            }
